**Behavior added:** `-h` / `--no-filename` option forces no filename prefix regardless of default rules.

**Last-one-wins resolution:** Single `prefix_mode` variable tracks state: -1 (default/unset), 0 (no prefix via `-h`/`--no-filename`), 1 (prefix via `-H`/`--with-filename`). Later options overwrite earlier ones. Final decision: mode=1 → prefix, mode=0 → no prefix, mode=-1 → default rule (prefix if file_count > 1).

